{"2538880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spirit X Strike", "steam_appid": 2538880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access Out Now</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more game updates and feedback, please join our discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/47ffb3fd931b4dfcaab0cf7e76084d04.avif?t=1763101279\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fresh take on this action adventure of  &quot;Spirit X Strike,&quot; featuring three intertwined combat systems: Instant Counter, Super Strike, and Spirit Mimicry. Players can swiftly switch between defense and attack, and experience an adrenaline-pumping combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Action storing and release system to break the limits of COMBO potential!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together action sequences using the game’s distinctive Spirit Mimicry. This system allows you to freely assemble moves and unleash them at the moment you desire. Even newcomers can easily execute stunning combos and air-juggle confirms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s Strike Time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break your opponents’ defense with well-timed counters and quick pressure, then execute them with the finishing &quot;Super Strike&quot;. There are a lot of different “Super Strike” finishers for different situations waiting for you to try out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Post-Apocalyptic Wasteland</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Carter, the inheritor of the Spirit Fist, and face off against top warriors in the Wasteland. Unearth your limitless potential and &quot;Strike&quot; your way through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fresh take on this action adventure of  &quot;Spirit X Strike,&quot; featuring three intertwined combat systems: Instant Counter, Super Strike, and Spirit Mimicry. Players can swiftly switch between defense and attack, and experience an adrenaline-pumping combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Action storing and release system to break the limits of COMBO potential!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together action sequences using the game’s distinctive Spirit Mimicry. This system allows you to freely assemble moves and unleash them at the moment you desire. Even newcomers can easily execute stunning combos and air-juggle confirms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s Strike Time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break your opponents’ defense with well-timed counters and quick pressure, then execute them with the finishing &quot;Super Strike&quot;. There are a lot of different “Super Strike” finishers for different situations waiting for you to try out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Post-Apocalyptic Wasteland</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Carter, the inheritor of the Spirit Fist, and face off against top warriors in the Wasteland. Unearth your limitless potential and &quot;Strike&quot; your way through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "An Action Adventure Game that lets you craft unique COMBOs and explore endless ways to style on your enemies with a high-speed combat system. Test your skills in fun chaotic one-vs-group battles, intense, strategic duels, and exhilarating post-apocalyptic adventure that will set your blood boiling.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, French, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/f3be6f882d4bfee11a960fd142cdd6377e345271/header.jpg?t=1763101279", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/6fe5581bf4d853a24ce3658044b63c1bbaf41ce6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763101279", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/6fe5581bf4d853a24ce3658044b63c1bbaf41ce6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763101279", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum: